From 3245fafc9c84f23e6fa3689df4da2bef8019d9a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:49:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] docs: a researched umbrella is closed, never kept open;
 research is claimed

Review of #294: keeping a needs-research umbrella open without the label
would let Pick take it for code. The umbrella is now always closed once
its sub-issues are filed (user: "broken down into issues and closed"),
and researching one is claimed like any issue but takes no branch, PR or
lane slot.

